<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Vaal Reefs Q1 available profit lower.</title>
<headline>Vaal Reefs Q1 available profit lower.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Available profit			  77.3 vs 101.7</p>
<p>    Capital spending			  75.8 vs 129.6</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			16,022 vs 16,991</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated	    3,443,000 vs 3,484,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			    4.65 vs 4.88</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  41,087 vs 39,155</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     53,501 vs 55,704</p>
<p>Full name: Vaal Reefs Exploration and Mining Co Ltd, managed by Anglo American of South AFrica Ltd.</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said Vaal Reefs was on track to meet its forecast gold production for 1997 of 70 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
